---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProjectGrid from '../components/ProjectGrid.astro';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="Quiet Compass — calm wayfinding for purposeful digital work" description="A quiet, experimental portfolio system where motion confirms structure and advanced engineering stays out of the way." element="earth" route="A01">
  <nav class="route-rail" aria-label="Page route" style="position:fixed;left:1rem;top:50%;z-index:30;display:grid;gap:.55rem">
    <a data-route-link href="#arrival">Arrival</a><a data-route-link href="#work">Work</a><a data-route-link href="#method">Method</a><a data-route-link href="#thinking">Thinking</a><a data-route-link href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>
  <section id="arrival" data-route-section data-element="earth" data-bearing="0">
    <div class="hero shell">
      <div data-reveal>
        <span class="route">A01 / ARRIVAL · INDEPENDENT STUDIO TEMPLATE / 2026</span>
        <h1>Build useful things<br/>with calm <em>character.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">A professional shell for people who want clarity without sterility—editorial structure, spatial balance, and enough experimentation to feel alive without becoming noisy.</p>
        <div class="actions"><a class="btn primary magnetic" href="#work">View selected work ↗</a><a class="btn magnetic" href="#method">Understand the process →</a></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="placard" data-reveal>
        <span class="route">NOW / AVAILABLE</span><p style="font-family:var(--display);font-size:var(--step-2);line-height:1.05">Purposeful digital experiences with room to breathe.</p>
        <div class="compass" aria-hidden="true"></div><canvas class="webgl-signature" data-webgl aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="work" data-element="water" data-bearing="62">
    <div class="shell" data-reveal>
      <div class="section-head"><div><span class="route">B02 / SELECTED WORK</span><h2 class="scroll-word">Evidence before adjectives.</h2></div><p>Projects preserve continuity as you enter them: the route stays visible, the compass reorients, and the case study becomes a sequence rather than a wall of content.</p></div>
      <ProjectGrid limit={3}/>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="method" data-element="wood" data-bearing="128">
    <div class="shell" data-reveal>
      <div class="section-head"><div><span class="route">C03 / METHOD</span><h2>Discover → Shape → Deliver.</h2></div><p>Each stage is an explicit route. The interface only adds motion when it clarifies progress, causality, or direction.</p></div>
      <svg class="route-svg is-active" viewBox="0 0 1000 90" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M20 45 C240 0 370 90 520 45 S760 15 980 45"/><circle cx="20" cy="45" r="8"/><circle cx="500" cy="45" r="8"/><circle cx="980" cy="45" r="8"/></svg>
      <div class="bento-grid"><article class="bento wide"><span class="route">01 / DISCOVER</span><h3>Research the terrain.</h3><p>Audience, positioning, constraints, systems, and the decision that actually matters.</p></article><article class="bento"><span class="route">02 / SHAPE</span><h3>Make the route legible.</h3><p>Identity, content architecture, prototypes, and interface rules.</p></article><article class="bento"><span class="route">03 / DELIVER</span><h3>Leave a system behind.</h3><p>Fast builds, documentation, accessible behavior, performance budgets, and handoff.</p></article></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="thinking" data-element="metal" data-bearing="218">
    <div class="shell" data-reveal>
      <div class="section-head"><div><span class="route">D04 / THINKING</span><h2>Experimentation behaves like punctuation.</h2></div><p>Space remains part of the interface. Motion confirms structure. The visual system can be sophisticated without asking the visitor to decode it.</p></div>
      <div class="intent-grid" aria-label="Choose a preferred route">
        <button class="intent" data-intent="strategy" aria-pressed="false"><strong>I need strategy</strong><p>Positioning, systems, prioritization.</p></button>
        <button class="intent" data-intent="identity" aria-pressed="false"><strong>I need identity</strong><p>Voice, visual language, expression.</p></button>
        <button class="intent" data-intent="web" aria-pressed="false"><strong>I need a website</strong><p>Architecture, interface, build.</p></button>
        <button class="intent" data-intent="product" aria-pressed="false"><strong>I need product design</strong><p>Research, flows, decisions.</p></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="contact" data-element="fire" data-bearing="315">
    <div class="shell" data-reveal><div class="section-head"><div><span class="route">E05 / NEXT ACTION</span><h2>Have somewhere worth going?</h2></div><div><a class="btn primary magnetic" href={base+'contact/'}>Send a project note →</a></div></div></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>